WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.755
The lake began to bubble and churn.

2
00:00:04.756 --> 00:00:08.152
Waves splashed onto the shore.

3
00:00:08.153 --> 00:00:14.593
A giant figure rose out of the water.

4
00:00:14.594 --> 00:00:22.265
"Whoa!" said Roxy, looking down. "I'm huge!"

5
00:00:22.266 --> 00:00:28.182
Downtown, Roxy slowly walked between the buildings.

6
00:00:28.183 --> 00:00:31.043
"Be careful," she told herself.

7
00:00:31.044 --> 00:00:42.014
"You don't want to step on anybody!"

8
00:00:42.015 --> 00:00:45.504
Roxy saw a frog clinging to Metro City Bank.

9
00:00:45.505 --> 00:00:47.962
The frog was slimy and gross.

10
00:00:47.963 --> 00:00:50.765
But now Roxy was much bigger than it.

11
00:00:50.766 --> 00:00:53.111
Roxy took a deep breath.

12
00:00:53.112 --> 00:00:56.012
"Okay. I can do this.

13
00:00:56.013 --> 00:00:58.456
I can pick up a frog."

14
00:00:58.457 --> 00:01:01.389
She closed her eyes and reached for the frog.

15
00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:03.621
Roxy felt it squish.

16
00:01:03.622 --> 00:01:07.598
"Eww!" she cried, quickly pulling her hand back.

17
00:01:07.599 --> 00:01:09.750
Roxy reached out again.

18
00:01:09.751 --> 00:01:13.796
This time she gently picked the slimy creature off the building.

19
00:01:13.797 --> 00:01:17.942
Holding the frog in her hand, Roxy zoomed back to the park.

20
00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:22.618
She dropped the frog into the purple lake. Splash!

21
00:01:22.619 --> 00:01:26.129
"That wasn't so bad," thought Roxy.

22
00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:29.640
Roxy flew back to downtown Metro City.

23
00:01:29.641 --> 00:01:33.212
One by one, she found all the frogs.

24
00:01:33.213 --> 00:01:36.898
She put all of them in the lake.

25
00:01:36.899 --> 00:01:41.256
"Whew!" said Roxy. "I'm glad that's done.

26
00:01:41.257 --> 00:01:43.846
But the frogs are still too big.

27
00:01:43.847 --> 00:01:45.614
And so am I.

28
00:01:45.615 --> 00:01:48.607
What made us grow in the first place?"

29
00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.621
Roxy thought for a moment.

30
00:01:50.622 --> 00:01:52.830
She looked down at the purple lake.

31
00:01:52.831 --> 00:02:01.564
"Aha!" she said. "The meteor!"

32
00:02:01.565 --> 00:02:05.551
Roxy stepped into the lake and fished around under the water.

33
00:02:05.552 --> 00:02:08.219
A moment later she felt the meteor.

34
00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.009
Roxy pulled it out of the lake.

35
00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.236
Right away the water lost its purple color.

36
00:02:14.237 --> 00:02:20.735
Roxy flung the meteor into the sky.

37
00:02:20.736 --> 00:02:25.570
The purple rock disappeared as it soared through space, far from Earth.

38
00:02:25.571 --> 00:02:28.197
Roxy started to feel strange again.

39
00:02:28.198 --> 00:02:30.829
"I'm shrinking!" Roxy thought.

40
00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:37.628
"And so are the frogs!"

41
00:02:37.629 --> 00:02:40.806
Roxy's friends were coming out of the woods.

42
00:02:40.807 --> 00:02:43.390
They stood near the lake.

43
00:02:43.391 --> 00:02:47.309
"I wonder where Roxy went," said Terrell.

44
00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.169
"Maybe she went home," said Jack.

45
00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:53.605
"She was really scared of the giant frog."

46
00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:56.610
Mara saw a frog hop out of the lake.

47
00:02:56.611 --> 00:02:58.622
She reached down.

48
00:02:58.623 --> 00:03:00.454
"Look!" she said.

49
00:03:00.455 --> 00:03:04.837
"Here's another frog—a normal-sized one."

50
00:03:04.838 --> 00:03:07.650
Just then Roxy appeared.

51
00:03:07.651 --> 00:03:09.980
"Hi everyone," she said.

52
00:03:09.981 --> 00:03:14.245
"I'm back. That giant frog sure was scary, right?"

53
00:03:14.246 --> 00:03:16.186
She looked at Mara.

54
00:03:16.187 --> 00:03:18.815
"Ooh! Can I hold that frog?"

55
00:03:18.816 --> 00:03:22.694
"I thought you were scared of frogs," said Mara.

56
00:03:22.695 --> 00:03:25.167
She handed the frog to Roxy.

57
00:03:25.168 --> 00:03:28.040
"Not anymore," said Roxy.

58
00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:31.016
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

59
00:03:31.017 --> 00:03:39.121
But he didn't say anything.

